<section data-sec style="background: #F3F3F1">
<div style="max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px); padding-top: 140px; padding-bottom: 140px; display: flex; gap: 48px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: stretch">
<figure style="flex: 1 1 560px; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<div style="position: relative; height: 540px; overflow: hidden; background: #1A1B1C"><video preload="none" data-src="/media/kiln.mp4" poster="/media/kiln-poster.webp" autoplay="" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; "></video><div style="position: absolute; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-color: #fff; border-style: solid; opacity: .85; left: 12px; top: 12px; border-width: 1px 0 0 1px"></div><div style="position: absolute; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-color: #fff; border-style: solid; opacity: .85; right: 12px; top: 12px; border-width: 1px 1px 0 0"></div><div style="position: absolute; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-color: #fff; border-style: solid; opacity: .85; left: 12px; bottom: 12px; border-width: 0 0 1px 1px"></div><div style="position: absolute; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-color: #fff; border-style: solid; opacity: .85; right: 12px; bottom: 12px; border-width: 0 1px 1px 0"></div></div>
<figcaption style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-family: GeistMono, monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; font-size: 11px; color: #6A6E70"><span>FIG. 01 · THE OLD WAY</span><span>KILN-FIRED CERAMICS · 1,000–1,400°C</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<div style="flex: 1 1 520px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 30px; padding: 4px 0 34px">
<div style="font-family: GeistMono, monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; color: #6A6E70">03 · THE BREAKTHROUGH</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
<div style="font-size: clamp(110px, 14vw, 210px); line-height: .8; letter-spacing: -0.07em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums"><span class="t-count"></span>°C</div>
<div style="height: 1px; background: #CFD0CE"><div class="t-bar" style="height: 1px; background: #151617"></div></div>
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-family: GeistMono, monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; font-size: 11px; color: #6A6E70"><span>1,300°C KILN</span><span>&lt;250°C OUROS</span></div>
</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; color: #3E4143; max-width: 520px">For 30,000 years, ceramics have meant fire. Our solidification chemistry works at a fraction of the heat, which lets polymers, and eventually metals, live inside a ceramic matrix.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

